WEBVTT

00:15:28.536 --> 00:15:30.503
You have taken the dreams of that

00:15:30.503 --> 00:15:32.115
nine-year-old boy,

00:15:32.115 --> 00:15:33.754
which were impossible

00:15:33.754 --> 00:15:36.644
and dauntingly scary,

00:15:36.644 --> 00:15:38.344
dauntingly terrifying,

00:15:38.344 --> 00:15:41.068
and put them into practice,

00:15:41.068 --> 00:15:44.301
and figured out a way to reprogram yourself,

00:15:44.301 --> 00:15:46.429
to change your primal fear

00:15:46.429 --> 00:15:49.328
so that it allowed you to come back

00:15:49.328 --> 00:15:53.268
with a set of experiences and a level of inspiration

00:15:53.268 --> 00:15:54.611
for other people

00:15:54.611 --> 00:15:57.737
that never could have been possible otherwise.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:05.347
Just to finish, they asked me to play that guitar.